      \delta Q_{xx} = \frac{\alpha \mu}{2c S_0^2}\delta\varepsilon_{xx}
\label{eq:Qpert}, \qquad \delta T_{xx}^R = 2\mu \left(1 - \frac{\alpha^2}{2c S_0^2}\right)\delta\varepsilon_{xx}.
