We will usually denote these vectors by $f_{kl}=v_k\wedge v_l$. The matrix coefficients of this representation are given by the $2\times 2$ minors of the matrices and the lowest weight vector in $\bigwedge^{2}\R^4$ is $f_{34}=v_3\wedge v_4$. Then
\beq{Function-n}
