\begin{proof}
Assume for the sake of contradiction that $u_r(d,2)> td+1+\binom{d-t+2}{2}-r$. This means that there is some $W\subseteq S_d(2,\kappa)$ with $\dim(W)=r$, $\gcd(W)=1$ and $|V(W)|_{\mm}\geq td+2+\binom{d-t+2}{2}-r$. Let $X=V(W)$ and pick a subset $X_1\subseteq X$, for which $|X_1|_{\mm}=td+2+\tbinom{d-t+2}{2}-r$. Note that
\[|X_1|_{\mm} \leq td+2+\tbinom{d-t+2}{2} -\big(2+\tbinom{d-t+1}{2}\big) =td+d-t+1.\]
