\begin{figure}[!ht]
    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=0.68\textwidth]{workflow.pdf}
    \caption{The Four-Stage HTR-LLM Workflow. The process begins with a one-time creation of a specialized HTR model (Stage 0), which then serves as the foundation for the repeatable four-stage pipeline that processes new documents.}
