\paragraph{Contributions}
In summary, this work provides the following contributions:
\begin{itemize}
  \item \textit{\lang{}}, a small probabilistic programming language
  \item An interval-based dependent typing strategy for probabilistic programs
  \item A synthesis algorithm that is sound with regard to the type system.
  \item A comparison, in a stochastic symbolic regression-like setting, of the algorithm in contrast to both untyped synthesis and a data-guided synthesis procedure~\cite{blogsynthesis}.
\end{itemize}

\section{Approach}
