    {\bf A}: Illustration of unpolarized light interacting with a homochiral macromolecule which induces partial circular polarization. {\bf B}: Examples of circular polarization spectra for a leaf in reflection (upper panel) and a cyanobacteria culture in transmission (lower panel). The data are unpublished measurements by J.~Grone (priv. comm.).
