The performance of the model for 8 different BRs is illustrated in Fig.\ref{fig:model_performance}, where the black lines represent our calculations for the best-fit proton fluxes, while the LIS used in the calculation is shown by the magenta line. Fits were independently conducted for each BR using the standard MINUIT routine. The minimizing function for a given BR is defined as:
\begin{equation}
