where the second product log function is evaluated at the same argument as the first. Now, the formula for $\wh{\delta}$ in \eqref{E:opt_delta_sigr_0} was defined when $\abs{\sigma_r} = 0$, and the formula for $\wh{\delta}$ in \eqref{E:wgdel_sigr_pos} (and hence $\wh{R}_{\delta}$ in \eqref{E:Rdelta_def}) was defined when $\abs{\sigma_{r}} >0$.  If we combine the two cases we obtain
